{"ref":"BDB, אָפֵס","hw":"אָפֵס","html":"† <big><big><span dir=\"rtl\">אָפֵס</span></big></big>  <strong>(</strong>cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, פָּסַס\" href=\"/BDB,_פָּסַס\", dir=\"rtl\">II. פָּסַס</a><strong>) vb. cease, fail, come to an end</strong>: only <strong>Qal</strong> Pf. 3 ms.; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 47:15\" href=\"/Genesis.47.15\">Gn 47:15</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 47:16\" href=\"/Genesis.47.16\">16</a> (of money, <span dir=\"rtl\">כֶּסֶף</span>), <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 16:4\" href=\"/Isaiah.16.4\">Is 16:4</a> (extortioner: ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">כָּלָה</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">תַּם</span>), <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 29:20\" href=\"/Isaiah.29.20\">29:20</a> (terrible one: ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">כָּלָה</span>, <span dir=\"rtl\">נִכְרַת</span>), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 77:9\" href=\"/Psalms.77.9\">ψ 77:9</a> (<span dir=\"rtl\">חַסְדּוֹ</span>: ‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">גָּמַר</span>).","next":"BDB, אֶ֫פֶס","prev":"BDB, אָפ֑וּנָה"}